WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.235
♪ ("MISTER ROGERS' NEIGHBORHOOD"
THEME PLAYS) ♪

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.535
FRED ROGERS:
<i> "Won't you be my neighbor?"</i>

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:07.107
<i> It's an invitation
 to help somebody know...</i>

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.076
<i> that they're loved...</i>

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.113
<i> and capable of loving.</i>

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.382
<i> Love is at the root
 of everything.</i>

00:00:16.882 --> 00:00:18.317
Love or the lack of it.

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.620
♪ (SOFT PIANO MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.623
DR. GEORGE WIRTH:<i> Fred's work
 was, "Love your neighbor</i>

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:24.624
<i> and love yourself."</i>

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.996
ROGERS:<i> Children have
 very deep feelings,</i>

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.133
<i> just the way everybody does.</i>

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.136
<i> There must be times
 when you do feel blue.</i>

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:38.938
I'm not feeling blue
right now, though.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.573
-Me neither!
-(CHUCKLES)

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:45.678
Thank you for whatever
you do to bring joy and hope...

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:49.649
<i> light and love...</i>

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.086
<i> to our world today.</i>

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.289
<i> ♪ Please won't you be
 My neighbor ♪</i>

